bundled files carry their own terms:

* `view/base/web/notice/` and `view/base/web/garan/` — the official artwork of
  the harmonised notice and the GARAN label, published by the European
  Commission for Implementing Regulation (EU) 2025/1960. These files are not
  CopeX's work and are not licensed under the MIT licence above. They are
